# Always: Error Learning Trigger

If any of these happen, load skill `error-learning-1c` (and project `project-*-error-learning-agent.mdc` if present):

- `check_1c_code` / `review_1c_code` failed;
- `v8std` diagnostic appears;
- runtime/deploy/test failed;
- user invokes `capture-error` or `reflect-lesson`;
- the same mistake appears again;
- risky CFE/base-config change was attempted.

**Before claiming the fix is done:** finish skill pipeline at least through **Store**.

| Scope | Store (same session) |
|---|---|
| Portable (другая КФ повторит) | Hub `agent-lessons/` + `index.md` + `catalog.jsonl` — **обязательно**, не «предложи потом» |
| Task / one config only | `memory-bank/reflection/reflection-YYYY-MM-DD-*.md` |

Do not create a new alwaysApply `.mdc` for one-off issues.  
Promote to alwaysApply rule only if repeated or critical (edit Hub `rules-shared`, then Sync).

Defer Hub promote only with explicit line: `PROMOTE_DEFER: <why>` (user said skip / not portable / needs repro).
